//
// Full mobilenet on the NPU2: @iron.jit compile, three launches on one hardware
// context, last output checked against golden_output.txt (atol=9, #3009).
//
// --sa-effort 0.25 keeps this compile's SA placement pass short; the nightly
// component check covers the full-effort budget (and a seed sweep) instead.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// RUN: cd %S/.. && %run_on_npu2% %python -m mobilenet.aie2_mobilenet_iron --sa-effort 0.25 -w 1 -i 2 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: PASS!
